 valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\">10</font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 81.1pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 16.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\">84</font></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">가. 재입학은 제적 당시의 학년, 학부(과, 전공)로 허가</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">나. 모집단위가 폐지된 학부(과, 전공)의 경우 학칙이 정하는 모집단위에 재입학 허가</font></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">6. 기타사항</font></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가. 재입학은 여석이 있는 경우에 한하여 허가합니다.(학사운영규정에 의거)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나. </font><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>재입학은 제적 당시의 학년/학부(과, 전공)으로 허가합니다. </strong></font></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>단, 모집단위가 폐지된 </strong></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 학부(과, 전공)의 </strong></font></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>경우 학칙이 정하는 모집단위로 재입학 허가합니다.</strong></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 다. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정합니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 라. 재입학 이전에 받은 학사경고와 휴학기간은 재입학 이후에 통산하지 않습니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 마 . 계약학과 재입학은 계학학과 입학자격요건을 각추어야 합니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 관련 문의 : 산학협력단 산학교육운영팀 </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">☎478-6733</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 바. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">재입학이 허가된 자는 지정된 기간 내에 등록금 납부 등 학적 절차를</strong></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;이행하여야 하며, 이행하지 않을 경우 재입학 허가 취소 처리 됩니다.</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 사. <strong>공학계열 재입학시 공학교육인증과정 변경방법</strong></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ① 2010학년도 이전 입학자</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 4학기 이내 : 4학기차에 공학인증 변경 가능</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 5학기~6학기 : 한 번도 공학인증 변경 신청대상이 되지 않은 경우 재입학한 후</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 최초 등록(재학) 학기에 변경 가능</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 7학기 이상 : 변경대상 아님</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ② 2011학년도 이후 입학자 : 공학교육인증과정 의무 이수(인증포기 안됨)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 변경신청 관련 문의 : 공학교육혁신센터 </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">☎478-7952</span></font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2016. 12.</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh, 궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh, 궁서\">금오공과대학교총장</span></span></font></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
